B.ahR=new A.lW('5. No warranty / "as is"',"Solar-IQ is provided AS IS and AS AVAILABLE. Readings, charts and cost estimates are indicative only and depend on data returned by the Shinemonitor API. We do not guarantee accuracy, uptime, or fitness for a particular purpose. Do not rely on the app for safety-critical decisions or for compliance with electrical regulations.",null)
